  "name": "Nuoxi (nuo ritual masked drama)",
  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Music of nuo, the masked exorcistic ritual drama of southwest and central China, including the nuo rites of Guizhou, the dixi masked drama of Anshun and the Nanfeng nuo dances of Jiangxi, several of which entered China's national intangible heritage list in 2006. Masked performers sing and chant in local dialect to gong and drum, with cymbals in many troupes; in Anshun dixi a single gong and drum accompany a lead singer whose line endings the group takes up.",
